<title>USA: PSA elects Deutsche's John Meehan chairman for '97.</title>
<headline>PSA elects Deutsche's John Meehan chairman for '97.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSA The Bond Market Trade Association said it elected John Meehan as its chairman for 1997.</p>
<p>Meehan is a managing director at Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and has served on the PSA board since 1994.</p>
<p>The organization recently changed its name from the Public Securites Association to PSA The Bond Market Trade Association.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
